ce</div></div></div><div class="ability"><button aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="ability-unmake" data-ability="unmake"><span class="ability-num">03</span><span class="ability-title">Brahmashira Unleashed</span><span class="plus" aria-hidden="true">+</span></button><div class="ability-content" id="ability-unmake" hidden=""><p>Recite the supreme mantra and release the pinnacle of cosmic force. One decisive strike severs the ten heads of ignorance and re-establishes the reign of truth.</p><div class="micro">Cosmic Release &nbsp; / &nbsp; Dharma → Victory</div></div></div><p class="combat-foot">SELECT AN ASTRA TO EXPLORE ITS FORM &nbsp; ↗</p></div></div></section>
<section class="locations" id="districts" aria-labelledby="district-heading"><p class="eyebrow">04 / Sacred realms</p><div class="locations-head reveal"><h2 class="section-title" id="district-heading">JOURNEY ACROSS<br>TRETA YUGA.</h2><p>Every sacred realm<br> has an immortal tale.</p></div><div class="district-grid"><button class="district-card reveal" data-district="0" aria-label="Explore Ayodhya"><img data-asset="AYODHYA" alt="Golden spires and Sarayu river at sunrise in Ayodhya" decoding="async"><span class="district-top"><span>01 — SOLAR CAPITAL</span><span class="danger">DHARMA: SUPREME</span></span><div class="district-copy"><p class="micro">Where the Sarayu whispers ancient hymns</p><h3>AYODHYA<br>THE ETERNAL</h3><span class="district-open">Enter realm <span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></span></div></button><button class="district-card reveal" data-district="1" aria-label="Explore Kishkindha"><img data-asset="KISHKINDHA" alt="Emerald jungle canyons and mountain caves of Kishkindha" decoding="async"><span class="district-top"><span>02 — MONKEY EMPIRE</span><span class="danger">VALOR: BOUNDLESS</span></span><div class="district-copy"><p class="micro">High upon Rishyamukha bluffs</p><h3>KISHKINDHA<br>CANOPY REALM</h3><span class="district-open">Enter realm <span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></span></div></button><button class="district-card reveal" data-district="2" aria-label="Explore Lanka"><img data-asset="LANKA" alt="The titanic fortress of Lanka guarded by the colossus Kumbhakarna under an amber blood moon" decoding="async"><span class="district-top"><span>03 — SEA FORTRESS</span><span class="danger">TITAN AWAKENED</span></span><div class="district-copy"><p class="micro">Beyond the stormy southern ocean</p><h3>LANKA<br>TITAN CITADEL</h3><span class="district-open">Enter realm <span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></span></div></button></div><div class="location-footer"><span>TRETA CHRONICLES / RECORDED IN THE VALMIKI ARCHI